\strong{Get bookmaker odds for a single event as they appeared at a point in time.}

Like \code{\link[=toa_event_odds]{toa_event_odds()}} but for a historical snapshot: accepts any available
market key (including player props and alternate lines) and returns the odds
at the snapshot closest to (and at or before) the requested \code{date}. Look up a
